| Names | Skill |
|-------|--------|
| Rybbit | `rybbit-analytics` |
| BoardUI / npx boardui | `boardui` |
| witr | `witr` |
| spec-kit / specify / /speckit-* | `github-spec-kit` |
| uipro / UI/UX Pro Max | `ui-ux-pro-max-setup` then generated `ui-ux-pro-max` |
